{
  "id": "c1-e12-community-and-well-being",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Community and well-being",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how important is it to you to feel part of a community?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you do when you feel under pressure?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, who do you turn to when you need support?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people are more or less lonely than they used to be?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e12-a1",
            "c1-e12-a2",
            "c1-e12-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people in different social situations. Choose two of the pictures and say how connected the people might feel, and what effect this could have on their well-being.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you think would make people happiest?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e12-b1",
            "c1-e12-b2",
            "c1-e12-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people taking care of their mental health. Choose two of the pictures and say why the people might have chosen these ways of coping, and how effective they might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you look after your own mental health?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways in which a community can support the mental health of its members, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e12-community-and-well-being",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these initiatives improve people's mental well-being?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e12-community-and-well-being",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would have the most lasting effect?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about mental well-being and community.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Why do you think more people seem to be talking openly about mental health nowadays?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should schools be responsible for students' emotional well-being?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is there still a stigma attached to mental illness in your country?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might social changes have affected people's sense of belonging?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should employers give more support to employees who are struggling?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, can technology offer a real alternative to face-to-face support?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e12-community-and-well-being/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
